# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — rpmalloc 1.4.5 aarch64 deferred free CAS ordering ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-08
# Software: rpmalloc 1.4.5
# Gate: upstream test test_crossthread / rpmalloc_finalize (HarmonyOS PC arm64, clang 15, -O2)
# Status: UNMATCHED — local snapshot scan found no equivalent entry; needs review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review error excerpt + verification below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv and doc/E0XX.md

id: DRAFT-rpmalloc-1.4.5-aarch64-deferred-free-cas-ordering
severity: 2
category: concurrency, memory-ordering, allocator, aarch64
trigger_tool: test|runtime|conan
phase: testing|runtime
approach: upgrade atomic_cas_ptr from memory_order_relaxed to memory_order_acq_rel/acquire on the deferred-free span list push

keywords: rpmalloc, deferred free, span_free_deferred, atomic_cas_ptr, relaxed, acquire, acq_rel, weak memory ordering, aarch64, arm64, Memory leak detected, finalize, linked list corrupted, cross thread free

error_signature: Memory leak detected.*rpmalloc_finalize: 3034|Assertion failed: .*_mapped_pages == 0|Linked list corrupted.*1105
match_keywords: rpmalloc, Memory leak detected, mapped_pages, finalize, deferred free, cross thread, aarch64, weak memory ordering, relaxed, CAS

root_cause: rpmalloc 1.4.5 的跨线程释放路径把完全释放的 span 以 relaxed CAS 推入 owner heap
  的 span_free_deferred 链表（span->free_list 复用为链表 next 指针），消费者用 acquire
  exchange 取出链表。在 aarch64 弱内存序 + 优化（-O2 及以上）下，生产者对 next 指针的
  写入与 CAS 之间缺少 release 同步，消费者可能读到损坏的 next，导致双向链表断言失败或
  span 永不 unmap，finalize 时 _mapped_pages != 0 报 "Memory leak detected"
affected_scope: 弱内存序（aarch64 等）平台上以 relaxed CAS + acquire exchange 配对推送/消费
  无锁链表的库，尤其内存分配器/数据结构库的 deferred free 类跨线程释放路径
verification_cmd: ./bin/linux/release/arm64/rpmalloc-test 2>&1 | tail -3; echo $?
  # 修复前: "Assertion failed: (atomic_load32(&_mapped_pages) == 0) ..." exit 134
  # 修复后: "All tests passed" exit 0
  # 附带: TMPDIR=~ python3 scripts/ohc-run.py conan-verify rpmalloc 1.4.5

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: upgrade-cas-memory-order
rec_description: 把 deallocate_defer_free_span 入链使用的 atomic_cas_ptr 由
  memory_order_relaxed 升级为 memory_order_acq_rel（成功）/memory_order_acquire（失败）。
  该 helper 的唯一调用点即 deferred span 入链，升级后先前的 next 指针写入以 release
  发布，与消费者的 acquire exchange 正确 synchronizes-with
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: source-patch

fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: disable-optimization-for-tests
fallback_description: 不推荐。在配方/测试中强制 -O0 掩盖竞态会偏离上游 Release 语义，
  且无法证明 aarch64 弱内存序下无竞态
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: none

forbid_1_pattern: skip.*test_crossthread|disable.*finalize.*assert|#define NDEBUG.*rpmalloc
forbid_1_reason: 跳过测试或关断言会掩盖回调中真实的内存序竞态，上游 2.0 重写即因此类问题
forbid_2_pattern: -O0.*测试|fno-optimize.*掩盖
forbid_2_reason: 降低优化不解决竞态，只改变时序，且偏离 Release 构建语义

principles: P005,P015
causes: []
caused_by: []
similar_to:
conflicts_with: []
prerequisite_of: []
